  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VUP market dev</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VUP marknadsutv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VUP Rwandas viktigaste program f&#xf6;r skydda de fattigaste mot shocker   och f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka de fattigas produktiva kapacitet p&#xe5; l&#xe4;ngre sikt.   Programmet inneh&#xe5;ller tre komponenter: i) subventionerade             arbetsprogram, ii) direkt st&#xf6;d och iii) mikro-kreditprorgam.          Insatserna under samtliga komponenter &#xe4;r riktade mot fattiga genom en lokalt genomf&#xf6;rd identifiring av per&#xe4;ttigade hush&#xe5;ll.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VUP is the Government of Rwanda&apos;s (GoR) main mechanism for protecting the poor from shocks and building poor households&apos; productive         capacity in the longer term. The programme has three components - i)  public works, ii) direct support and iii) access to credits -         reinforce and complement each other. The components are all targeted, through a community based approach, on the very poorest.</narrative>
  </description>
